As @samouss said it's not possible to use HTML tags in `<option>` but what I see in your title is that you want to get rid of counts. And for this, InstantSearch.js provides a solution, you can use a template for `item` that does not contain the count:

```js
window.search.addWidget(
  instantsearch.widgets.menuSelect({
    container,
    attributeName: 'categories', // replace with the relevant attribute in your index 
    templates: {
      item: '{{label}}',      
    },   
  })
);
```

Let us know @emeagenciadigital
